#: about.php include/global_arrays.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Mayelana ne-Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "I-Cacti yakhelwe ukuba ibe isixazululo esiphelele sokudweba amagrafu esisekelwe ku-RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) kanye nesixazululo sokudweba amagrafu. Inhloso yayo ukwenza umsebenzi woMlawuli Wenethiwekhi ube lula ngokunakekela yonke imininingwane ebalulekile edingekayo ukuze kwakhiwe amaGrafu anengqondo."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Sicela ubheke %1$siwebhusayithi esemthethweni ye-Cacti%2$s ukuze uthole ulwazi ngendlela yokusebenzisa i-Cacti, ukuthola ukwesekwa, kanye nezibuyekezo."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Abathuthukisi Abasebenzayo"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Abathuthukisi abasebenza ku-Cacti, Ukwakheka Kwayo, Amadokhumenti kanye Nokukhishwa Kwezinguqulo Ezizayo."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Ababalulwa Ngokuhlonishwa"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Abanikeli kumaDokhumenti, i-QA, Ukupakisha, Izinkundla zokuxoxisana kanye nekhasi lethu le-YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Amalungu E-Emeritus"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Amalungu eqembu lokuqala le-Cacti Group aseguqule imisebenzi yawo kusukela lapho. Siyaqhubeka nokubafisela okuhle kodwa."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Ukubonga"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Ukubonga okukhethekile kakhulu ku-%1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, umdali we-%3$sRRDtool%4$s kanye ne-%5$sMRTG%6$s edume kakhulu."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Abasebenzisi be-Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Ikakhulukazi noma ubani othathe isikhathi sokwakha umbiko wenkinga, noma osizile ngandlela-thile ukulungisa izinkinga ezihlobene ne-Cacti. Futhi nakubani oye wafaka isandla ekwesekeni i-Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Ilayisense"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "I-Cacti inelayisense ngaphansi kwe-GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Lolu hlelo luyisofthiwe yamahhala; ungalusabalalisa kabusha futhi/noma ulushintshe ngaphansi kwemigomo ye-GNU General Public License njengoba ishicilelwe yi-Free Software Foundation; inguqulo 2 yeLayisense, noma (ngokukhetha kwakho) noma iyiphi inguqulo yakamuva."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Lolu hlelo lusatshalaliswa ngethemba lokuthi luzoba usizo, kodwa NGAPHANDLE KWANOMA YISIPHI ISIQINISEKISO; ngaphandle kwesiqiniseko esicatshangelwayo SOKUDAYISEKA noma SOKULUNGELA INHLOSO ETHILE. Bheka i-GNU General Public License ukuze uthole imininingwane eyengeziwe."

