#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Isihloko (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Igama eliphrintwa kugrafu. Lingafaka okuguquguqukayo kokushintsha okufana no-|host_description| noma |query_fieldName|. Ukuze uthole uhlu oluphelele lwamathegi okushintsha asekelwayo, sicela ubheke imibhalo ye-Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Ilebuli Emile (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Ilebuli ephrintwe ngokuma mpo ngakwesokunxele segrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Ifomethi Yesithombe (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Uhlobo lwegrafu olukhiqizwayo; i-PNG, i-GIF noma i-SVG. Ukukhethwa kohlobo lwesithombe segrafu kuncike kakhulu ku-RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Ubude (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Ubude (ngamaphikseli) bendawo yegrafu ngaphakathi kwegrafu. Le ndawo ayihlanganisi incazelo yezimpawu, izincazelo zama-eksisi, noma isihloko."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Ububanzi (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Ububanzi (ngamaphikseli) bendawo yegrafu ngaphakathi kwegrafu. Le ndawo ayihlanganisi incazelo yezimpawu, izincazelo zama-eksisi, noma isihloko."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Inani Elisisisekelo (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Kufanele isethwe ku-1024 kumemori naku-1000 ezilinganisweni zethrafikhi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Imodi Yomthambeka (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Ukusebenzisa Imodi Yomthambeka kulinganisa isimo samagrafu kodwa kwehlise kancane ukucaca kwesikrini."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zesikali"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Isikali Esizenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Linganisa isikali se-eksisi ye-y ngokuzenzakalelayo esikhundleni sokuchaza umkhawulo ongaphezulu nongaphansi. Qaphela: uma lokhu kukhethiwe, kokubili umkhawulo Ongaphezulu noNgaphansi kuzozitshwa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zesikali Esizenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Sebenzisa <br> --alt-autoscale ukuze ukale kuze kufike enanini eliphansi kakhulu neliphezulu kakhulu <br> --alt-autoscale-max ukuze ukale kuze kufike enanini eliphezulu kakhulu, usebenzisa umkhawulo ongaphansi onikiwe <br> --alt-autoscale-min ukuze ukale kuze kufike enanini eliphansi kakhulu, usebenzisa umkhawulo ongaphezulu onikiwe <br> --alt-autoscale (enemikhawulo) ukuze ukale usebenzisa kokubili umkhawulo ongaphansi nongaphezulu (okuzenzakalelayo kwe-RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa --alt-autoscale (kuzitshwa imikhawulo enikiwe)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa --alt-autoscale-max (kwamukelwa umkhawulo ongaphansi)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa --alt-autoscale-min (kwamukelwa umkhawulo ongaphezulu)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa --alt-autoscale (kwamukelwa yomibili imikhawulo, okuzenzakalelayo kwe-RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Ukukala Nge-Logarithmic (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Sebenzisa ukukala kwe-eksisi ye-y nge-Logarithmic"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Amayunithi e-SI Okukala Nge-Logarithmic (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Sebenzisa Amayunithi e-SI Okukala Nge-Logarithmic esikhundleni sokusebenzisa ukubhalwa ngamandla.<br> Qaphela: Amagrafu aqondile asebenzisa ukubhalwa kwe-SI ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Imodi Yemikhawulo Eqinile (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Unganwebi umkhawulo ongaphansi nongaphezulu uma igrafu iqukethe inani elingaphandle kwebanga elivumelekile."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Ongaphezulu (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu elime mpo legrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Ongaphansi (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Inani eliphansi elime mpo legrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zegridi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Inani Legridi Yeyunithi (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Isetha inani le-exponent ku-eksisi ye-Y lezinombolo. Qaphela: Le nketho ayisasetshenziswa futhi ithathelwe indawo yinketho ethi --y-grid. Kule nketho, imigqa yegridi ye-eksisi ye-Y ivela esikhawini ngasinye sesinyathelo segridi. Amalebula abekwa njalo emigqeni eyisici selebula."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Inani Le-Exponent Yeyunithi (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Iyiphi iyunithi okufanele i-Cacti iyisebenzise ku-eksisi ye-Y. Sebenzisa u-3 ukubonisa konke ku-\"k\" noma u--6 ukubonisa konke ku-\"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Ubude Beyunithi (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Zingaki izinombolo okufanele i-RRDtool icabange ukuthi amalebula e-eksisi ye-y anazo? Kungase kudingeke usebenzise le nketho ukuze wenze isikhala esanele uma usuqala ukulungisa ukufakwa kwamalebula e-eksisi ye-y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Ukungalinganisi Negridi (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ukuze kugwenywe imiphumela yokufiphala ye-anti-aliasing, i-RRDtool ihlanganisa amaphuzu namaphikseli wokucaca kwedivayisi, lokhu okuletha ukubukeka okucace bha. Uma lokhu ungakuthandi, ungasebenzisa lesi shintshi ukucisha lokhu kuziphatha.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Ukulinganisa negridi kucishiwe kokuphuma kwe-PDF, EPS, SVG ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Igridi Ye-Y Ehlukile (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "I-algorithm iqinisekisa ukuthi uhlala unegridi, ukuthi kunemigqa yegridi eyanele kodwa engeminingi kakhulu, nokuthi igridi ingeyemethrikhi. Le pharamitha izophinde iqinisekise ukuthi uthola amadesimali anele abonisiwe ngisho noma igrafu yakho isuka ku-69.998 iye ku-70.001.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Le pharamitha ingase iphazamise izinketho ezithi --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zama-eksisi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "I-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "I-eksisi yesibili izodwetshwa ngakwesokudla kwegrafu. Ixhunywe ku-eksisi yangakwesobunxele ngamapharamitha esikali nokushintsha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Ilebula Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ilebula ye-eksisi yangakwesokudla."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Ifomethi Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, ifomethi yamalebula e-eksisi inqunywa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Uma ufuna ukukwenza lokhu ngokwakho, sebenzisa le nketho ngezimpikiswano ezifanayo ze-%lf ozaziyo emiyalweni ye-PRINT ne-GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomethi se-Eksisi Yesokudla (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Uma usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi yesokudla, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha. Amafomethi asekelwayo ahlanganisa u-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, u-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lamasekhondi kusukela ngoMasingana 1970) futhi avezwa kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Bheka futhi u---units-length no---right-axis-format. Okokugcina u-\"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngamamilisekhondi. Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efaneleke nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomethi se-Eksisi Yesobunxele (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Uma usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi yesobunxele, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha. Amafomethi asekelwayo ahlanganisa u-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, u-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lamasekhondi kusukela ngoMasingana 1970) futhi avezwa kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Bheka futhi u---units-length. Okokugcina u-\"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngamamilisekhondi. Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efaneleke nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Izinketho ze-Legend"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Ukugcwalisa Isikhala Okuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Gcwalisa isikhala sombhalo ukuze i-legend nedatha yegrafu kuhlale kuqondana ngaso sonke isikhathi. Qaphela: lokhu kungabangela ukuthi amagrafu athathe isikhathi eside ukukhiqizwa ngenxa yomsebenzi owengeziwe. Futhi Ukugcwalisa Isikhala Okuzenzakalelayo kungase kungabi nembayo kuzo zonke izinhlobo zamagrafu, ukulebula okungaguquguquki kuvame ukusiza."

