#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yezimvume Zegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kunezindlela ezine zokunquma Izimvume Zegrafu Zomsebenzisi. Eyokuqala ithi 'Evumelayo'. Ngaphansi kwesethingi ethi 'Evumelayo', Umsebenzisi udinga ukufinyelela kuGrafu, Idivayisi noma Ithemplethi Yegrafu kuphela ukuze athole ukufinyelela kuMagrafu asebenza kuye. Ngaphansi kwethi 'Ekhawulelayo', Umsebenzisi kufanele abe nokufinyelela kuGrafu, Idivayisi, kanye neThemplethi Yegrafu ukuze athole ukufinyelela kuGrafu. Lezi zindlela ezimbili zokuqala zinezinkinga zokukhula ekufakweni okukhulu kakhulu. Ngakho-ke, kunezinketho ezimbili ezengeziwe ezitholakalayo. Zithi 'Okusekelwe Kudivayisi', okusho ukuthi uma unokufinyelela Kudivayisi, uthola ukufinyelela kuMagrafu ayo. Futhi okokugcina 'Okusekelwe Kuthemplethi Yegrafu', okusho ukuthi uma unokufinyelela ku-'Themplethi Yegrafu' uthola ukufinyelela kuwo wonke Amagrafu Edivayisi alelo Themplethi."

