#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Usizo Lwekhasi Lwasendaweni Kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ngokwakhona usizo lwekhasi le-Cacti lutholakala ku-docs.cacti.net. Nokho, uma isistimu yakho ingenakho ukufinyelela ku-Inthanethi, ungalanda imibhalo endaweni yakho ngefomethi ye-HTML bese uyigcina endaweni ye-'docs' yeseva yakho ye-Cacti. Uma ukhetha ukusebenzisa kuphela indawo yasendaweni ukuze uthole imibhalo yosizo lwekhasi, maka leli bhokisi lokuhlola."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa Kokususwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Buza umsebenzisi ngaphambi kokususwa kwento."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Ukusetha Ngaphambilini Kokulondoloza Umthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, i-Cacti izosetha Inkinobho Yerediyo ukuze Isuse Imithombo Yedatha ehlobene Negrafu lapho isusa Amagrafu. Qaphela: I-Cacti ngeke ikuvumele ukususwa Kwemithombo Yedatha uma isetshenziswa kwamanye Amagrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Ukuvula Amagrafu Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, i-Cacti ngeke ikhiye Amagrafu. Lokhu kuvumela ukuguqulwa okusheshayo ngesandla Kwemithombo Yedatha ehlobene Negrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Fihla Ideshibhodi Ye-Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Ukuze kusetshenziswe Nokusekelwa Kwezixhumanisi Zangaphandle Ze-Cacti. Ngokusebenzisa le sethingi, ungafihla Ideshibhodi Ye-Cacti, ukuze ubonise ikhasi lakho kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
