msgstr "Nika Amandla Ukudonsa Nokudedela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Ezinye izindawo zokusebenzelana ze-Cacti zisekela Ukudonsa Nokudedela. Uma kumakiwe le nketho izonikwa amandla. Qaphela: Kubasebenzisi abanokukhubazeka kokubona, le nketho ingakhutshazwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Ukuphepha Kwesayithi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Phoqelela Ukuxhumana nge-HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, noma yimiphi imizamo yokufinyelela i-Cacti izoqondiswa kabusha ku-HTTPS ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuphepha okuphezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Vumela I-HTTPS Engaphephile Yomqoqi Wedatha Okude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Vumela ukusetshenziswa Kwezitifiketi Ezizisayinele futhi uvumele igama le-host leSitifiketi ukuthi lihluke kweloMqoqi Wedatha Okude."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Vumela Izinhlamvu Ezingaphephile Ezinezimpawu Ezihlukile (Metacharacters) Ezindleleni Zokufaka Idatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Ngokomlando, abaphathi be-Cacti babedala Izindlela Zokufaka Idatha ezilula ezifaka imiyalo efana nokuthi \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" ukuze zimele inani lezinombolo elizokusetshenziswa ku-Cacti Graphs. Ezinhlelweni zangaphambilini ze-Cacti, lokhu kwakuvunyelwe. Nokho, lo ngumkhuba ongaphephile njengoba uyisango lokuthi abasebenzisi bezinkampani zangaphandle bashicilele Izifanekiso Zedatha ezingaphephile. Ku-Cacti yesimanje, lezi zinhlobo zemikhuba kufanele zigwenywe. Nokho, sihlinzeka ngale nketho uma uneZindlela Zokufaka Idatha ezindala eziqukethe lezi Zinhlamvu Ezinezimpawu Ezihlukile ezingaphephile futhi ongazange uziguqulele kuma-script endawo kufolda ye-'scripts'. Uma le nketho ingamakiwe, i-Cacti ivimbela izinhlamvu zesitayela se-shell ezifana nomaki bokucaphuna, abakaki abagobile, imigoqo emile, ama-backslash, nama-backtick. I-Cacti iyaqhubeka nokuvumela izimpawu zokukhulu kuno nokuncane kuno ezintweni ezifana ne-<path_cacti> kanye namapharamitha okufaka, kodwa uma le nketho ingamakiwe, lowo ngumkhawulo wokusetshenziswa kwazo okuvunyelwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Inqubomgomo Ye-Script Yokuphepha Kokuqukethwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Ilawula inqubomgomo ye-CSP ye-script-src. Kuma-Nonce Modes, ama-Plugin e-Cacti asebenzisa i-JavaScript engaphakathi komugqa kumele afake isibaluli se-nonce esivela kumsebenzi owakhelwe ngaphakathi we-Cacti othi 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Ngaphandle kwalokho, leyo miyalelo (scripts) izovinjelwa yisiphequluli. Njengamanje, i-Cacti ivumela kuphela ukubika ngama-Plugin e-Cacti angasebenzisi kahle i-Nonce Mode. Esikhathini esizayo, sizovumela Abaphathi ukuthi bavimbele ama-plugin anjalo ekusebenziseni i-JavaScript yawo engaphakathi komugqa uma engasebenzisi ama-Nonce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Vumela I-JavaScript Engaphakathi Komugqa Engena-Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Vumela kokubili i-unsafe-eval kanye ne-JavaScript Engaphakathi Komugqa Engena-Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Imodi Ye-Nonce - Ukubika Kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "I-URI Yombiko Wokwephulwa kwe-CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "I-URL lapho iziphequluli zithumela khona ngokuthi POST imibiko yokwephulwa kwe-CSP kumamodi we-nonce-report kanye ne-nonce. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise i-<url_path>/csp_report.php. Kumele iqukathe izinhlamvu ze-URL eziphephile kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Imithombo Ehlukile ye-Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amagama esizinda ahlukaniswe ngesikhala azokwazi ukufinyelelwa ngaphandle kweSeva yeWebhu uqobo. Lokhu kubalulekile kubasebenzisi abakhetha ukusebenzisa i-CDN, noma isayithi lokusingatha. Imithombo ingabandakanya ama-wildcard isibonelo: *.mydomain.com, noma iphrothokholi, isibonelo: https://*.example.com. Le Mithombo Ehlukile ihlanganisa izinhlobo zeSithombe, i-CSS ne-JavaScript kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "I-URL lapho iziphequluli zithumela khona nge-POST imibiko yokwephulwa kwe-CSP ezindleleni ze-nonce-report neze-nonce. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise i-/cacti/csp_report.php empandeni yokufakwa. Kumele iqukathe izinhlamvu ze-URL eziphephile kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Nika Amandla Ukudala Igrafu Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Uma kukhutshaziwe, Ukuzenzekela kwe-Cacti ngeke kudale noma iyiphi Igrafu ngokuzenzakalela. Lokhu kuwusizo uma ulungisa izilungiselelo Zedivayisi ukuze ugweme ukudala Amagrafu amasha njalo uma ulondoloza into. Ukubiza Imithetho Yokuzenzekela ngesandla kuzohlala kungenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Nika Amandla Ukudala Into Yesihlahla Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Uma kukhutshaziwe, Ukuzenzekela kwe-Cacti ngeke kudale noma iyiphi Into Yesihlahla ngokuzenzakalela. Lokhu kuwusizo uma ulungisa izilungiselelo Zedivayisi noma Zegrafu ukuze ugweme ukudala Okufakiwe Kwesihlahla okusha njalo uma ulondoloza into. Ukubiza Imithetho ngesandla kuzohlala kungenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "I-imeyili Yokuthumela Isaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Ikheli Le-imeyili okuzothunyelwa kulo Ama-imeyili Ezaziso Zokuzenzekela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Uma le nkambu, noma inani Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa i-akhawunti Ye-imeyili Yabalawuli Abakhulu be-Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Igama Lomthumeli Lesaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Igama Le-imeyili elizosetshenziselwa Ama-imeyili Ezaziso Zokuzenzekela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Uma le nkambu, noma inani Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa Igama Lomthumeli elizenzakalelayo lesistimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "I-imeyili Yomthumeli Yesaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Ikheli le-imeyili elizosetshenziswa kuma-imeyili ezaziso zokuzenzakalela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni lenethiwekhi yokuzenzakalela. Uma le nkambu noma inani lenethiwekhi yokuzenzakalela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa ikheli le-imeyili lokuthumela elizenzakalelayo lesistimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo kwesifanekiso segrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Ukuhlola umthombo wedatha wesifanekiso segrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi lokuhlola uma ufisa ukuhlola imithombo yedatha ngaphambi kokwakhiwa kwayo ezifanekisweni zegrafu ezintsha nezisanda kungeniswa. Uma ukuhlola imithombo yedatha kuvuliwe, uma umthombo wedatha ungabuyisi idatha evumelekile, igrafu ngeke yakhiwe. Lesi silungiselelo sibalulekile uma ufisa ukuba nesifanekiso sedivayisi esijwayelekile esingafaka izifanekiso zegrafu eziningi ezingasetshenziswa ngokukhetha kuye ngezici zedivayisi uqobo. Qaphela: Uma uneskripthi esisebenza isikhathi eside njengomthombo wedatha, isikhathi sokwakha amagrafu sizokwanda."

#: include/global_settings.php
