#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Se-Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ukuvama lapho umqoqi wedatha we-Cacti ezoqaliswa khona. Ungasebenzisa i-crontab, umsebenzi ohleliwe (ku-Windows), noma isevisi ye-cactid systemd ukulawula ukuqaliswa komqoqi wedatha we-Cacti. Ukuze uthole imiyalelo ngokusebenzisa i-daemon ye-cactid, buyekeza ifayela le-README.md kuhla lwemibhalo lwesevisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Linganisa Umthwalo Wenqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Uma ukhetha le nketho, i-Cacti izozama ukulinganisa umthwalo wenqubo ngayinye ye-poller ngokusabalalisa ngokulinganayo izinto ze-poller ngenqubo ngayinye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ububanzi Bokuphumayo Bokulungisa Amaphutha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Uma ukhetha le nketho, i-Cacti izohlola okukhiphayo okwedlula amandla e-Cacti okukugcina bese ikhipha isixwayiso uma ikuthola."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Se-ejenti Ekude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Isikhathi, ngamasekhondi, iseva yewebhu ye-Cacti Emaphakathi ezolinda ngaso impendulo evela Kumqoqi Wedatha Okude ukuze ithole imininingwane ehlukahlukene Yedivayisi ngaphambi kokudela isicelo. Kumadivayisi ahlotshaniswa Nabaqoqi Bedatha abahlukile kuMqoqi Wedatha we-Cacti Omaphakathi, Umenzeli Okude kufanele asetshenziswe ukuqoqa imininingwane Yedivayisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Vuselela Ithebula Le-Poller Umjikelezo Ngamunye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Lesi silungiselelo ngesamasistimu e-poller eyodwa kuphela ukuze kwakhiwe kabusha ithebula lokuphumayo le-poller kumjikelezo ngamunye wokuhlola ukuvimbela ithebula lenkumbulo ukuthi lingashintshani (swapping) kumasistimu amakhulu kakhulu anemininingo egciniwe emikhulu engasebenzisa i-swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Khubaza Ukuphindaphindwa Kwesilondolozi Sezinsiza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, Umqoqi Wedatha omkhulu we-Cacti uzolondoloza isizindalwazi sonke kanye nama-plugin ku-Resource Cache. Bese, ngezikhathi ezithile Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude bazozibuyekeza nganoma yiziphi izibuyekezo ezivela kuMqoqi Wedatha omkhulu we-Cacti. Le Resource Cache ivumela Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude ukuthi bazithuthukise ngokwabo. Uma ungafisi ukusebenzisa le nketho, ungayikhubaza usebenzisa lesi silungiselelo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Ukuziphatha kwe-SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Ukusekelwa kwe-SNMP Agent kuvuliwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Uma le nketho imakiwe, i-Cacti izogcwalisa amathebula e-SNMP Agent ngolwazi lwedivayisi nolwesistimu ye-Cacti. Lokhu akuvuli i-SNMP Agent uqobo lwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Vula i-MD5 ne-DES ye-SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ama-algorithm okufakazela e-MD5 nawobumfihlo e-DES amadala, abuthakathaka, futhi awatholakali ekwakhiweni kwe-PHP ne-Net-SNMP okuqinisiwe (FIPS). Uma kuvaliwe, i-MD5 ne-DES kukhishwa ezinhlwini ezehlayo zephrothokholi yokufakazela neyobumfihlo ye-SNMPv3 eziboniswa uma uhlela idivayisi nakuzinketho ze-SNMP zokuzenzakalela, kushiye kuphela ama-algorithm aqinile e-SHA ne-AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Vula i-cache yemininingwane yokuqinisekisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Qinisa kusengaphambili futhi ugcine ku-cache amapharamitha emininingwane ye-SNMPv3 kanye njalo uma imininingwane ishintsha ukuze inqubo ngayinye ye-poller iwasebenzise futhi esikhundleni sokuwakha kabusha kuso sonke isicelo. Lokhu kuletha ukonga okuncane uma uqoqa ngemininingwane ye-SNMPv3 ngamabhanari e-Net-SNMP. Isandiso se-php-snmp siphatha iningi lemisebenzi ye-SNMPv3 get ngaphakathi kwenqubo futhi sidlule le cache, kodwa amabhanari e-Net-SNMP (ngakho-ke nale cache) asasetshenziselwa ama-SNMP walk, okukhiphayo kwe-hex, izicelo ezisetha i-context noma i-engine id, kanye nezinhlanganisela zamaphrothokholi inguqulo ye-PHP esebenzayo engazisekeli. Vula lokhu uma uqoqa noma yimiphi yaleyo misebenzi ngemininingwane ye-SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Umkhawulo we-OID ye-SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu elizenzakalelayo lama-OID e-SNMP Get okufanele akhishwe ngesicelo ngasinye se-snmpget. Kumadivayisi, lesi silungiselelo silawulwa ezingeni ledivayisi. Kufanele usebenzise lesi silungiselelo kuphela uma usebenzisa i-SNMP API ye-Cacti ngokuqondile ezikripthini zakho noma kuma-plugin akho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Usayizi Wokulanda we-SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Mangaki ama-OID okufanele abuyiswe ngesicelo ngasinye se-snmpbulkwalk? Kumadivayisi anezihlahla ezinkulu ze-SNMP, ukwandisa lo sayizi kuzothuthukisa ukusebenza kokuhlela kabusha inkomba ku-WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Khubaza Ukuhlola Okwandayo kwe-OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Kulawula ukukhubaza ukuhlola kokwanda kwe-OID ngesikhathi kuhanjwa esihlahleni se-OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezingeziwe Zomqoqi Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ukubhalwa Kwedatha Engavumelekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuthi amaphutha okukhiphayo Komqoqi Wedatha abhalwe kanjani? Izinketho zifaka: 'Okuningiliziwe' okunikeza imininingwane yawo wonke amaphutha, 'Isifinyezo' esinikeza inani lamaphutha okukhiphayo ngeDivayisi ngayinye, kanye no-'Lutho', okunganikezi izibalo zamaphutha."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Isifinyezo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Okuningiliziwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Inani Lamaseva Eskripthi e-PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani lezinqubo zamaseva eskripthi ezisebenza kanyekanye ngenqubo ngayinye ye-spine. Izilungiselelo eziphakathi kuka-1 no-15 zamukelekile. Le pharamitha izosiza uma usebenzisa imicu eminingi nezikripthi zamaseva eskripthi futhi isebenza kuphela kuMqoqi Wedatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Inani Lesikhathi Sokuphelelwa Kweskripthi Neseva Yeskripthi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Isikhathi esikhulu lapho i-spine izohlala ilinde ukuthi iskripthi siqede. Leli nani lokuphela kwesikhathi likumasekhondi futhi lisebenza kuphela kuMqoqi Wedatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Ukufakwa Kwama-Index Kabusha Kwezidivayisi Zonke Ngezikhathi Ezithile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Ishejuli Yokufaka Ama-Index Kabusha Kwezidivayisi Zonke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Ufisa ukufaka ama-index kabusha zonke Izidivayisi kangaki. Lokhu kufaka ama-index kabusha kuzokwenzeka phakathi kwamabili ngesikhathi osikhethayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Masonto onke ngeSonto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Nyanga zonke ngeSonto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Zokuphela Kwesikhathi Kwangemuva Nezenqubo Ezisebenza Ngesikhathi Esisodwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Isikhathi Sokuphela Kokukhiqiza Umbiko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Isikhathi esikhulu iskripthi Sokukhiqiza Imibiko se-Cacti esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphela kwesikhathi futhi sinqanyulwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Umzuzu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesikhathi Wezibalo Zomthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu iskripthi Sezibalo Zomthombo Wedatha se-Cacti esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphelelwa yisikhathi nokumiswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesikhathi We-RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Isikhathi esikhulu iskripthi sokuhlola i-RRDfile se-Cacti esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphela kwesikhathi futhi sinqanyulwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Ihora"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesikhathi Wemiyalo Ye-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu iskripthi se-Cacti se-Background Commands esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphelelwa yisikhathi nokumiswa. Lesi skripthi sizokwenza imisebenzi efana nokufaka ama-index kabusha Izidivayisi nokususa izidivayisi Kubaqoqi Bedatha Abakude."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Izinqubo Ezisebenza Kanyekanye Zomyalo We-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Inani lezinqubo Ezisebenza Kanyekanye Zomyalo We-Poller. Kuzoba nomyalo owodwa kuphela osebenza kanyekanye nge-host ngayinye ngaphakathi kweqoqo le-Poller Command."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Inqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Izinqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesikhathi Wokukhiqiza Kwangemuva Kokulungisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu iskripthi Sokulungisa se-Cacti esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphelelwa yisikhathi nokumiswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesikhathi Wokukhiqiza Kwangemuva Kwe-Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu iskripthi se-Spikekill se-Cacti esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphelelwa yisikhathi nokumiswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo Komqoqi Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Lezi zilungiselelo zigcinwa ezingeni loMqoqi Wedatha. Amanani alapha angokuzenzakalelayo okusetshenziswa kuphela uma udala uMqoqi Wedatha okokuqala."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Izinqubo Zomqoqi Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Inani elizenzakalelayo lezinqubo ezisebenza ngesikhathi esisodwa ezizokwenziwa ngoMqoqi Wedatha ngamunye. QAPHELA: Kusukela ku-Cacti 1.2, lesi silungiselelo sigcinwa kuMqoqi Wedatha. Ukuqhubekela phambili, leli nani liyisilungiselelo sangaphambilini nje soMqoqi Wedatha. Ukusebenzisa inani eliphakeme uma usebenzisa i-cmd.php kuzothuthukisa ukusebenza. Ukuthuthukiswa kokusebenza ku-Spine kuxazululwa kangcono ngepharamitha yama-thread. Uma usebenzisa i-Spine, sincoma inani eliphansi futhi usebenzise ama-thread esikhundleni salokho. Uma usebenzisa i-cmd.php, ungasebenzisi okungaphezu kuka-2x wenani lama-core e-CPU."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Ama-thread Ngenqubo Ngayinye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ama-thread Azenzakalelayo avunyelwe ngenqubo ngayinye. QAPHELA: Kusukela ku-Cacti 1.2+, lesi silungiselelo sigcinwa kuMqoqi Wedatha, futhi lokhu kuyisilungiselelo sangaphambilini nje. Ukusebenzisa inani eliphakeme uma usebenzisa i-Spine kuzothuthukisa ukusebenza. Kodwa-ke, qiniseka ukuthi unokuxhumana okwanele kwe-MySQL/MariaDB ukuze usekele le zibalo ezilandelayo: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers). Kumele futhi uqiniseke ukuthi unokuxhumana okusele okwanele kokuxhumana kokungena kwabasebenzisi nakho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokuqinisekisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ukuqinisekisa Okwakhelwe Ngaphakathi</i> - I-Cacti iphatha ukuqinisekiswa kwabasebenzisi, okukuvumela ukuthi udale abasebenzisi futhi ubanike amalungelo ezindaweni ezahlukene ngaphakathi kwe-Cacti.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa Okuyisisekelo Kwewebhu</i> - Ukuqinisekisa kuphathwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi bangengezwa noma badalwe ngokuzenzakalelayo ekungeneni okokuqala uma Umsebenzisi Wesifanekiso echaziwe, kungenjalo kuzosetshenziswa izimvume zesivakashi ezichaziwe.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa Kwe-LDAP</i> - Kuvumela ukuqinisekisa ngokubhekiswa kwiseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi bazodalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo ekungeneni okokuqala uma Umsebenzisi Wesifanekiso echaziwe, kungenjalo kuzosetshenziswa izimvume zesivakashi ezichaziwe. Uma imojuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP inganikiwe amandla, Ukuqinisekisa Kwe-LDAP ngeke kuvele njengenketho ekhethekayo.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa Kwesizinda Se-LDAP/AD Esiningi</i> - Kuvumela abalawuli ukuthi basekele amaqembu amaningi ahlukene avela ezinkambeni ze-LDAP/AD ezahlukene ukuze bafinyelele izinsiza ze-Cacti. Njengasekuqinisekiseni Kwe-LDAP, imojuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP iyadingeka ukuze kusetshenziswe le ndlela.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Sekela Amakhukhi Okuqinisekisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Uma umsebenzisi eqinisekisa ubuwena bese ekhetha u-'Ngigcine ngingenile', ikhukhi lokuqinisekisa lizokwakhiwa kukhompyutha yomsebenzisi elivumela lowo msebenzisi ukuthi ahlale engenile. Ikhukhi lokuqinisekisa liphelelwa isikhathi ngemva kwezinsuku ezingu-90 lokungasetshenziswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Abasebenzisi Abakhethekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Umlawuli Oyinhloko"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Igama le-akhawunti yomlawuli eyinhloko ezothola ama-imeyili ngokuzenzakalelayo uma uhlelo lwe-Cacti lunezinkinga. Ukuze uthole la ma-imeyili, qiniseka ukuthi izilungiselelo zakho zeposi zilungile, futhi i-akhawunti yomlawuli inekheli le-imeyili elisethiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Akukho Msebenzisi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Umsebenzisi Oyisivakashi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi oyisivakashi lokubuka amagrafu; ngu-'Akukho Msebenzisi' ngokwakhona."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Isifanekiso Somsebenzisi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi elizosetshenziswa yi-Cacti njengesifanekiso sabasebenzisi abasha be-Web Basic ne-LDAP; ngu-'guest' ngokwakhona. Le akhawunti yomsebenzisi izokhutshazwa ekungeneni lapho isikhethiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Zokuqinisekisa Okuyisisekelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Umlayezo Wokuhluleka Kokungena Wokuqinisekisa Okuyisisekelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa ukuqinisekisa okuyisisekelo, uma kunezinkinga zokumepha igama lomsebenzisi ku-akhawunti ye-Cacti evumelekile, umlayezo ofakwe lapha uzoboniswa kubasebenzisi. Ungafaka kokubili umbhalo ne-HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Ifayela Lemephu Yokuqinisekisa Okuyisisekelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa ukuqinisekisa okuyisisekelo, uma i-akhawunti eyisisekelo idinga ukuhunyushelwa ku-akhawunti yokungena ehlukile, ungacacisa ifayela le-CSV lapha ukuze umephe i-akhawunti eyisisekelo ku-akhawunti yokungena oyifunayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Izidingo Zobunkimbinkimbi Be-akhawunti Yasendaweni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Ubude Obuncane"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Lobu ubude obuncane bamaphasiwedi avunyelwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Dinga Izinhlamvu Ezixubile Ezinkulu Nezinhlamvu Ezincane"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Lokhu kuzodinga ukuthi amaphasiwedi amasha aqukathe izinhlamvu ezincane nezinkulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Dinga Inombolo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Lokhu kuzodinga ukuthi amaphasiwedi amasha aqukathe okungenani uhlamvu lwenombolo olu-1."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Dinga Uhlamvu Olukhethekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Lokhu kuzodinga ukuthi amaphasiwedi amasha aqukathe okungenani uhlamvu olukhethekile olu-1."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Phoqelela Ubunkimbinkimbi Emaphasiwedini Amadala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Lokhu kuzodinga ukuthi wonke amaphasiwedi amadala nawo ahlangabezane nezidingo ezintsha zobunkimbinkimbi lapho engena. Uma kungahlangatshezwana nazo, kuzophoqelela ushintsho lwephasiwedi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Phelelisa Isikhathi Ama-akhawunti Angasebenzi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Leli inani eliphakeme lezinsuku ngaphambi kokuba ama-akhawunti angasebenzi akhutshazwe. I-akhawunti yoMlawuli ayifakiwe kule nqubomgomo."

#: include/global_settings.php
