msgstr "Leli igama lesingathi/IP leseva ye-SMTP ozothumela kuyo i-imeyili. Ukuze kuhluleke kuphinde kusebenze enye, hlukanisa abasingathi bakho usebenzisa i-semi-colon."

#: include/global_settings.php
