msgstr "Ingabe i-Boost kufanele inike amandla ukubuyekezwa kwe-RRD ngokufuneka ku-Cacti? Uma ukhubaza, lolu shintsho ngeke lusebenze kuze kube ngemva komjikelezo olandelayo wokuhlola. Uma unabaQoqi Bedatha Abakude, lesi silungiselelo kudingeka sivulwe."

