msgstr "Inani lezinqubo ze-Boost ezisebenza kanyekanye ezizosetshenziselwa ukucubungula wonke ama-RRD kuthebula le-Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Inani Elikhulu Lamarekhodi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Uma ithebula lokuphumayo le-Boost lidlula lo sayizi, ngamarekhodi, kuzokwenzeka ukubuyekeza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Imigqa Yengobo Yomlando Ehlosiwe Ngebanga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Isibuyekezi se-Boost sabela ama-Local Data ID aphelele kumabanga ahlangene aseduze nalesi sibalo semigqa. I-Local Data ID eyodwa ayihlukaniswa neze, ngakho-ke ibanga lingeqa kulokho okuhlosiwe. Yehlisa leli nani ukuze unciphise inkumbulo yesibuyekezi nesikhathi sombuzo. Inani elizenzakalelayo ngu-50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Ubude Obukhulu Be-Argument"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Uma i-Boost ithumela imiyalo yokubuyekeza ku-RRDtool, akufanele idlule Ubude Obukhulu Be-Argument besistimu yokusebenza. Lokhu kuyahluka ngesistimu yokusebenza nezinga le-kernel. Isibonelo: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ okungenamkhawulo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wememori We-Boost Ne-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
