msgstr "Inani eliphezulu Leziqondisi Zedivayisi ezizokwakhiwa ngokusekelwe kuma-ID Edivayisi afakwe i-hash."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Iseva ye-Proxy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Igama lomsingathi le-DNS noma ikheli le-IP leseva ye-proxy ye-RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Inombolo Yembobo ye-Proxy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "Imbobo ye-TCP yokuxhumana okubethelwe."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "I-Fingerprint ye-RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "I-fingerprint yokhiye wamanje womphakathi we-RSA osetshenziswa yi-proxy. Lokhu kuyadingeka ukuze kusungulwe ukuxhumana okuthembekile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Iseva ye-Proxy ye-RRDtool - Isipele"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Ukulinganisa Umthwalo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Uma kokubili i-proxy eyinhloko kanye neyesipele zitholakala, le nketho ivumela ukusabalalisa zonke izicelo eziya ku-RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Igama lomsingathi le-DNS noma ikheli le-IP leseva ye-proxy yesipele ye-RRDtool uma i-proxy isebenza kumodi ye-MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "Imbobo ye-TCP yokuxhumana okubethelwe ne-proxy yesipele."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "I-fingerprint yokhiye wamanje womphakathi we-RSA osetshenziswa yi-proxy yesipele. Lokhu kuyadingeka ukuze kusungulwe ukuxhumana okuthembekile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo ze-Spike Kill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokususa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Kunezindlela ezimbili zokususa. Eyokuqala, i-Standard Deviation, izosusa noma iyiphi isampula ekude ngenani elithile elingu-X lokuphambuka okujwayelekile (standard deviations) kusukela esilinganisweni samasampula. Indlela yesibili, i-Variance, izosusa noma iyiphi isampula engaphezu kuka-X% kunesilinganiso se-Variance. Indlela ye-Variance icabangela inani elithile 'lama-outlier'. Lawo ngamasampula ahlukile, njengokwenyuka okukhulu okungajwayelekile (spike), okudingeka akhishwe ekubalweni Kwesilinganiso Se-Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Ukuchezuka Okujwayelekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Okusekelwe Ku-Variance Ngama-Outlier Asusiwe"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokubuyisela Esikhundleni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Kunezindlela ezintathu zokushintsha. Indlela yokuqala ishintsha ukwenyuka okuzumayo ngesilinganiso somthombo wedatha othintekayo. Indlela yesibili ishintsha ukwenyuka okuzumayo ngo-'NaN'. Eyokugcina ishintsha ukwenyuka okuzumayo ngenani lokugcina elaziwayo elihle elitholakele."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Isilinganiso"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Ama-NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Elokugcina Elaziwayo Elihle"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Inani Leziphambuko Ezijwayelekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Noma yiliphi inani elingaphezu kwesilinganiso ngalezi ziphambuko ezijwayelekile eziningi lizokhishwa. Inani elihle lizoncika ohlotsheni lwedatha ezosetshenzwa. Sincoma inani elingekho ngaphansi Kweziphambuko Ezijwayelekile ezi-5."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Iziphambuko Ezijwayelekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Iphesenti Le-Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Leli nani limele iphesenti elingaphezu kwesilinganiso sesampula esilungisiwe uma ama-outlier esesusiwe esampuleni. Ngokwesibonelo, Iphesenti Le-Variance elingu-100%% esilinganisweni esilungisiwe sika-50 lingasusa noma iyiphi isampula engaphezu kwenani elingu-100 kugrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Inani Lamanani Aphambukayo Ekuhlukahlukeni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
