msgstr "Inani Lamarekhodi Angaxhunyiwe:"

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Ungene Kumqoqi Wedatha Okude. Uma <b>'kuxhunyiwe'</b>, uzokwazi ukubuka nokulawula okuningi Kwewebhusayithi Eyinhloko ye-Cacti njengokungathi ungene kuyo. Futhi, kubalulekile ukuqaphela ukuthi Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude kuyadingeka ukuthi basebenzise isici Sezinsizakalo Zokukhuphula Ukusebenza ze-Cacti esithi <b>'Ukuvuselela Ngokufunwa'</b>, futhi sihlala sincoma ukusebenzisa i-Spine. Uma Umqoqi Wedatha Okude <b>'engaxhunyiwe'</b>, Iwebhusayithi Yabaqoqi Bedatha Abakude izoqukatha ulwazi oluncane kakhulu. Kodwa-ke, izogcina zonke izibuyekezo ku-cache kuze kube yilapho Isizindalwazi Esiyinhloko se-Cacti Neseva Yewebhu kufinyeleleka. Bese izothululela okukhiphayo kwethebula layo le-Boost emuva Esizindalwazini Esiyinhloko se-Cacti ukuze kuvuselelwe."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Awekho ama-Plugin Ayinhloko e-Cacti, kuze kube manje, aklanywe kabusha ukuthi asebenze Nabaqoqi Bedatha Abakude. Ngakho-ke, ama-Plugin afana ne-MacTrack, ne-HMIB, adinga ukufinyelela okuqondile kumadivayisi ngeke asebenze Nabaqoqi Bedatha Abakude ngalesi sikhathi. Kodwa-ke, ama-plugin afana ne-Thold azosebenza inqobo nje uma Umqoqi Wedatha Okude ekumodi ethi <b>'kuxhunyiwe'</b>."

