msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Uma kuba nezinkinga, kunconywa kakhulu ukuthi usule i-cache yesiphequluli sakho, uvale bese uvula kabusha isiphequluli sakho (hhayi nje ithebhu ekuyo i-Cacti) uphinde uzame, ngaphambi kokubika inkinga ku-The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Ngezikhathi ezingavamile, sike sathola imibiko evela kubasebenzisi ababhekana nezinkinga ezincane ngenxa yezinguquko kukhodi. Lezi zinkinga zibangelwa ukuthi isiphequluli sigcina ikhodi yangaphambi kokuthuthukiswa futhi nakuba sithathe izinyathelo zokunciphisa amathuba alokhu, kungase kwenzeke. Uma udinga imiyalelo yokuthi ungayisula kanjani i-cache yesiphequluli sakho, i-<a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> iyisiqalo esihle."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Uma ngemva kokusula i-cache yakho nokuqala kabusha isiphequluli sakho, usabhekana nezinkinga, sicela ubike inkinga kithi futhi sizozama ukuthola imbangela yayo."

