msgstr "Ukucushwa Kufundwa Kuphela!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Ifayela lakho le-config.php kufanele libhaleke ngeseva yewebhu ngesikhathi sokufaka ukuze kucushwe i-Remote poller. Uma ukufaka sekuqediwe, kufanele usethe leli fayela ukuthi Lifundwe Kuphela ukuze uvimbele izinkinga zokuphepha ezingenzeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Ukucushwa Kwe-Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Ulwazi lwakho lwe-Remote Cacti Poller alufakiwe efayeleni lakho le-config.php. Sicela ubuyekeze i-config.php.dist, futhi usethe okuguquguqukayo: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, njll. Lokhu okuguquguqukayo kufanele kusethwe futhi kukhombe emuva kuseva yakho yesizindalwazi Esiyinhloko ye-Cacti. Lungisa lokhu bese uzama futhi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Okuguquguqukayo Kwe-Remote Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Okuguquguqukayo okufanele kusethwe efayeleni le-config.php kuhlanganisa okulandelayo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Isifaki sinikeza ngokuzenzakalelayo i-$poller_id futhi siyengeze efayeleni le-config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Uma zonke izinto eziguquguqukayo sezisethwe efayeleni elithi config.php, kufanele futhi unikeze u-$rdatabase_username ukufinyelela kuseva eyinhloko yesizindalwazi se-Cacti. Landela inqubo efanayo obungayilandela kunoma ikuphi okunye ukufakwa kwe-Cacti. Ungabe usucindezela inkinobho ethi 'Hlola Ukuxhumana'. Uma ukuhlolwa kuphumelela uzokwazi ukuqhubeka futhi uqedele ukufaka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Izinyathelo Ezengeziwe Ngemva Kokufaka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Kubalulekile ukuthi iseva eyinhloko ye-Cacti ikwazi ukuxhumana nge-MySQL neseva yesizindalwazi se-Cacti ngayinye ekude. Uma ukufaka sekuqediwe, kufanele uhlele Umqoqi Wedatha Okude futhi uqinisekise ukuthi izilungiselelo zilungile. Ungaqinisekisa ngokusebenzisa okuthi 'Hlola Ukuxhumana' lapho uhlela Umqoqi Wedatha Okude."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Izindawo Ezibalulekile Zamafayela Ebhayinari Nezinguqulo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Qinisekisa ukuthi wonke lawa manani alungile ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Indlela eyodwa noma ngaphezulu ibonakala ingalungile, akukwazi ukuqhubeka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Ukuhlola Izimvume Zohla Lwemibhalo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Sicela uqinisekise ukuthi izimvume zohla lwemibhalo ezingezansi zilungile ngaphambi kokuqhubeka. Ngesikhathi sokufaka, lezi zinhla zemibhalo kudingeka zibe ngezomsebenzisi weSeva Yewebhu. Lezi zinguquko zezimvume ziyadingeka ukuvumela Isifaki ukuthi sifake amaphakheji Ezifanekiso Zedivayisi ahlanganisa amafayela e-XML nawezikripthi azobekwa kulezi zinhla zemibhalo. Uma ukhetha ukungawafaki amaphakheji, kuneskripthi se-CLI esithi 'install_package.php' esingasetshenziswa kusuka kulayini womyalo ngemva kokuba ukufaka sekuqediwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Ngemva kokuba ukufaka sekuqediwe, ungakwenza ezinye zalezi zinhla zemibhalo zifundeke kuphela ukuze wandise ukuphepha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Lezi zinhla zemibhalo kuzodingeka zihlale zifundeka futhi zibhaleka ngemva kokufaka ukuze inqubo yokuvumelanisa okukude ye-Cacti ikwazi ukuzibuyekeza njengoba iWebhusayithi Eyinhloko ye-Cacti ishintsha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Uma ufaka amaphakheji, uma amaphakheji esefakiwe, kufanele ushintshe uhla lwemibhalo lwezikripthi lubuyele ekufundekeni kuphela njengoba lokhu kudala ubungozi obuthile kuwebhusayithi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Kumaphola akude, kubalulekile ukuthi izindlela ozozibuyekeza njalo, okuhlanganisa izindlela zama-plugin, ezikripthi, kanye nezinsiza zibe nokufinyelela kokufunda/ukubhala njengoba umqoqi wedatha kuzodingeka abuyekeze lezi zindlela kusuka kokuqukethwe kweseva yewebhu eyinhloko."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Kudingeka Kubhaleke Ngesikhathi Sokufaka Kuphela"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Akubhaleki"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Kudingeka Kubhaleke Ngemva Kokuqeda Ukufaka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Izinkinga ezingaba khona zezimvume"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Sicela uqinisekise ukuthi iseva yakho yewebhu inokufinyelela kokufunda/ukubhala kumafolda e-Cacti akhombisa amaphutha ngezansi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Uma i-SELinux inikwe amandla kuseva yakho, ungakhetha ukuyikhubaza unomphela, noma uyikhubaze okwesikhashana bese wengeza izimvume ezifanele usebenzisa amathuluzi olayini womyalo we-SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Umsebenzisi u-'%s' kufanele abe nemvume ye-MODIFY ukuze avumele ukufunda/ukubhala."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Isibonelo sendlela yokusetha izimvume zefolda siboniswe lapha, nakuba kungase kudingeke ulungise lokhu kuye ngohlelo lwakho lokusebenza, ama-akhawunti omsebenzisi kanye nezimvume ezifiswayo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "ISIBONELO:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Uma ukufaka sekuqediwe indlela ye-CSRF kufanele isethwe ukuthi ifundeke kuphela."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Wonke amafolda ayabhaleka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Ukuvikelwa Kohlu Olugunyaziwe Lokuqinisekisa Okufakwayo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Izindlela Zokufaka Idatha ze-Cacti ezibiza isikripthi zingaxhashazwa ngezindlela lapho umuntu ongeyena umlawuli engalimaza amafayela e-akhawunti yomphola, futhi ezimweni lapho umuntu esebenzisa umphola we-Cacti njengo-root, kungabeka engcupheni uhlelo lokusebenza okuvumela abahlaseli ukuthi baxhaphaze ingqalasizinda yakho."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ngakho-ke, ezinguqulweni ezimbalwa ezedlule, i-Cacti yathuthukiswa ukuze inikeze amakhono Ohlu Olugunyaziwe kulezi zinhlobo Zezindlela Zokufaka Idatha. Nakuba lokhu kuyivikela ngokuphelele i-Cacti, kwandisa umsebenzi odingekayo kumlawuli we-Cacti ukuze angenise futhi aphathe Izifanekiso Namaphakheji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Indlela Ukugunyaza Uhlu okusebenza ngayo ukuthi uma uqala ukungenisa Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, noma ungenisa kabusha Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, bese isikripthi kanye/noma ama-agumenti eshintsha nganoma iyiphi indlela, Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, kanye nayo yonke Imithombo Yedatha ehambisanayo izokhutshazwa ngokushesha kuze kube yilapho umlawuli eqinisekisa ukuthi Indlela Yokufaka Idatha isebenza ngokusemthethweni."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Ukuze kwenziwe lula ukukhomba Izindlela Zokufaka Idatha ezikulesi simo, sihlinzeke ngesikripthi sokuqinisekisa kuhla lwemibhalo lwe-CLI ye-Cacti esingasetshenziswa ngezinketho ezilandelayo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Le nketho yesikripthi izosesha noma yiziphi Izindlela Zokufaka Idatha ezivinjelwe njengamanje futhi inikeze imininingwane yokuthi kungani."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Le nketho yesikripthi isusa ukuvinjelwa Kwezindlela Zokufaka Idatha ezivinjelwe njengamanje."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Le nketho yesikripthi izovula kabusha noma yimiphi Imithombo Yedatha ekhutshaziwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Kunconywa kakhulu ukuthi ubuyekeze i-config.php yakho ukuze unike amandla lesi sici ngokususa ukuphawula kokuguquguqukayo kwe-<b>$input_whitelist</b> bese usebenzisa izinketho ezintathu zeskripthi se-CLI ngenhla ngemva kokuba ukufakwa okusekelwe kuwebhu sekuqediwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Faka uphawu ebhokisini lokuhlola elingezansi ukuze uvume ukuthi ufundile futhi uyakuqonda lokhu kukhathazeka ngokuphepha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Ngisifundile lesi sitatimende"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Iphrofayela Ezenzakalelayo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Sicela ukhethe Iphrofayela Yomthombo Wedatha ezenzakalelayo ezosetshenziselwa ukuhlola imithombo. Lesi isikhathi esiphezulu phakathi kokuskena amadivayisi ukuze kutholakale ulwazi ngakho-ke uma isikhawu sokuhlola siphansi, umsebenzi uba mningi kusikhungo se-Cacti Server. Futhi, khetha isikhawu se-Cron esihlosiwe noma esilungiselelwe ofisa ukusisebenzisela Ukuqoqwa Kwedatha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu se-Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
