msgstr "Ukufaka akukwazi ukuqhubeka ngoba awekho amaphrofayela atholakele."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Lokhu kungenzeka uma unesizindalwazi esingenalutho futhi ungakalingenisi ifayela le-cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Ukumiswa Kwesifanekiso"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Sicela ukhethe Izifanekiso Zedivayisi ofisa ukuzibuyekeza ngesikhathi Sokuthuthukisa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Ukubuyekeza Izifanekiso osuvele wenze izinguquko kuzo akunconywa. Ukuthuthukiswa Kwezifanekiso AKUZUKUSUSA izinguquko Kuzifanekiso Zegrafu Nezedatha, futhi kungaholela ekuziphatheni okungalindelekile. Nokho, uma ungazange wenze izinguquko kunoma iyiphi Igrafu, Umbuzo Wedatha, noma Isifanekiso Sedatha, ukungenisa kabusha Iphakheji akufanele kube nomphumela. Kuleso simo, kuzodingeka 'Uvumelanise Amagrafu' kusuka Kuzifanekiso ngemuva kokubuyekeza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If you Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Sicela ukhethe Izifanekiso Zedivayisi ofisa ukuzisebenzisa ngemva kokufaka. Uma Isistimu Yakho Yokusebenza kuyi-Windows, udinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi ukhetha Isifanekiso se-'Windows Device'. Uma Isistimu Yakho Yokusebenza kuyi-Linux/UNIX, qiniseka ukuthi ukhetha Isifanekiso Sedivayisi se-'Local Linux Machine'."

