#: user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Imodi lapho i-Cacti izozama khona ukuqinisekisa ubuqiniso ngokumelene neseva ye-LDAP.<blockquote><i>Akukho Ukusesha</i> - Akukho ukusesha kwe-Distinguished Name (DN) okwenzekayo, zama nje ukubopha ngefomethi ye-Distinguished Name (DN) enikeziwe.<br><br><i>Ukusesha Okungaziwa</i> - Izama ukusesha igama lomsebenzisi kuhlu lwemibhalo lwe-LDAP ngokubopha okungaziwa ukuthola i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Ukusesha Okuthile</i> - Izama ukusesha igama lomsebenzisi kuhlu lwemibhalo lwe-LDAP nge-Specific Distinguished Name (DN) kanye ne-Specific Password yokubopha ukuthola i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Amaphasiwedi Esikhathi Esinye (OTP/MFA)</i> - I-Cacti ibopha iphasiwedi yomsebenzisi kanye kuphela, ngesikhathi sokuqinisekisa kokugcina. <i>Akukho Ukusesha</i> akwenzi ukusesha kohlu lwemibhalo futhi kubopha ngokuqondile usebenzisa isifanekiso se-Distinguished Name (DN), ngakho kuphephile ku-OTP lapho isifanekiso se-DN sodwa sihlonza umsebenzisi. Uma kudingeka ukusesha kohlu lwemibhalo ukuxazulula i-DN, sebenzisa <i>Ukusesha Okuthile</i> nge-akhawunti yesevisi ezinikele (noma <i>Ukusesha Okungaziwa</i> lapho uhlu lwemibhalo lukuvumela khona) ukuze ukusesha kungaze kudle ikhodi yomsebenzisi esetshenziswa kanye. Ukuze uthole ukusetshenziswa kwe-OTP okuqinile sebenzisa igama elilodwa le-DNS load balancer enkundleni ethi Iseva (Amaseva) kunohlu lwamaseva amaningi oluhlukaniswe ngesikhala, okungazama futhi ukubopha ngephasiwedi yesikhathi esinye esivele isetshenzisiwe."

#: user_domains.php
