msgstr "Isihlungi sokusesha esisetshenziselwa ukuthola umsebenzisi kuhla lwemibhalo lwe-LDAP, njengaku-windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> noma ku-OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  I-\"&lt;username&gt\" ishintshwa ngegama lomsebenzisi elinikezwe emyalezweni wokungena ngemvume."

